    Constructs 14 points in 3D maximizing dmin/dmax.

    Approach: multi-start local optimization of the (scale-invariant)
    ratio dmin/dmax using scipy SLSQP from random starts on the unit
    sphere, plus structured starts (icosahedron + 2 points). The best
